TextFlux Source Snapshot

Upstream source:
  https://github.com/yyyyyxie/textflux
  revision c791924acc4a93d48021c3731a75fada805cc501

This repository is a deployment-oriented source snapshot derived from the
upstream source listed above. It is not an official release of TextFlux and
does not claim endorsement by the upstream authors.

Modifications to the pinned upstream tree are limited to repository
documentation and policy files, plus the removal of the following evaluation
OCR checkpoints:

  eval/ocr_weights/ppv3_rec.pth
  eval/ocr_weights/ppv3_rec_en.pth

The upstream license files are retained without modification. Checkpoints,
model weights, and other separately distributed artifacts are not included.
